9. Logging Tools
Tools: ELK Stack (Elasticsearch, Logstash, Kibana)

Use: Centralized log management and analysis.
Why ELK?
Earlier tools like syslog or manual log parsing were:
Hard to scale.
Inefficient in large environments.
ELK offered:
Advanced search and analytics.
Centralized log storage with Kibana for visualization.
Drawbacks of Manual Log Management:
Time-consuming and lacked real-time insights.
